bbcode_enabled = true
bbcode_text = "[center][b]Hi everyone, 
we are back with a crossover item from 
Oaken Tower, the Time Pendant!

At the same time, they added a whole selection 
of BPB items into their game. 

Also, we have some balance adjustments.
Have fun and see y’all soon! :)

- Doro and Mario

1.1.9b
Bug fix / additional balance changes:[/b]
Hi everyone, again!
So it turns out only the labels for relative cooldown advances were 
broken, while the mechanic was already working correctly.
We now fixed the labels and rolled the cooldown changes back.
Instead, here are 2 other nerfs to address Holy Spear/Cubes. 
We will monitor how they pan out and readjust if necessary :)
[/center]
o Chromium Cube: Cooldown advance 2s -> 1.5s 
o Bismuth Cube: Cooldown advance 0.3s -> 0.2s

[center][b]1.1.9[/b][/center]
o NEW TREASURE ITEM: Time Pendant

[b]Balancing[/b]
[center][b]Neutral[/b][/center]
o Boiling Pot: Heat/ Regeneration 6 -> 8
o Holy Spear: Damage -2
o Pandamonium: Poison crit chance 4% -> 5%

[center][b]Pyromancer[/b][/center]
o Sun Shield: Damage blocked 18 -> 20

[center][b]Berserker[/b][/center]
o Wolf Emblem: Cooldown 2.3s -> 2.5s

[center][b]Mage[/b][/center]
o Cupdrake: Food bonus 15% -> 20%

[center][b]Adventurer[/b][/center]
o Heart Shield: Damage blocked 18 -> 20

[center][b]Engineer[/b][/center]
o Electric Torch: Blind duration 7s -> 8s
o Balance-relevant bug fix: Plastic cube now advances the cooldown 
   by 75% of the current value, rather than the base value. 
   This means less effect on heavily sped up items.
"
text = "Hi everyone, 
we are back with a crossover item from 
Oaken Tower, the Time Pendant!

At the same time, they added a whole selection 
of BPB items into their game. 

Also, we have some balance adjustments.
Have fun and see y’all soon! :)

- Doro and Mario

1.1.9b
Bug fix / additional balance changes:
Hi everyone, again!
So it turns out only the labels for relative cooldown advances were 
broken, while the mechanic was already working correctly.
We now fixed the labels and rolled the cooldown changes back.
Instead, here are 2 other nerfs to address Holy Spear/Cubes. 
We will monitor how they pan out and readjust if necessary :)

o Chromium Cube: Cooldown advance 2s -> 1.5s 
o Bismuth Cube: Cooldown advance 0.3s -> 0.2s

1.1.9
o NEW TREASURE ITEM: Time Pendant

Balancing
Neutral
o Boiling Pot: Heat/ Regeneration 6 -> 8
o Holy Spear: Damage -2
o Pandamonium: Poison crit chance 4% -> 5%

Pyromancer
o Sun Shield: Damage blocked 18 -> 20

Berserker
o Wolf Emblem: Cooldown 2.3s -> 2.5s

Mage
o Cupdrake: Food bonus 15% -> 20%

Adventurer
o Heart Shield: Damage blocked 18 -> 20

Engineer
o Electric Torch: Blind duration 7s -> 8s
o Balance-relevant bug fix: Plastic cube now advances the cooldown 
   by 75% of the current value, rather than the base value. 
   This means less effect on heavily sped up items.
"
script = ExtResource( 5 )

